{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeskBCPUm7coqe43Px2tp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## REVIEW\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` completed with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 5 original shipment tests still pass (tests run 1-5 in the output)\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment** — Test \"confirms a created shipment\" verifies CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent** — Uses `ConflictException` (409) and `ResourceNotFoundException` (404) like other endpoints; consistent error envelope with ErrorCode\n5. ✅ **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled is refused; unknown is refused** — Three separate tests cover: idempotent success on CONFIRMED, 409 on CANCELLED, 404 on not found\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** — Only modified Kotlin source and test files; no changes to pom.xml\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified files within shipment feature plus ApiError.kt for error code\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Changed | Why |\n|------|---------|-----|\n| `ApiError.kt` | Yes | Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED` error code to distinguish the conflict case of confirming a cancelled shipment from other conflicts |\n| `ShipmentController.kt` | Yes | Added `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` method implementing the four cases: not found (404), cancelled (409), already confirmed (idempotent), created (transition and save) |\n| `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` | Yes | Added 4 new tests covering all requirement cases: confirm created, confirm already confirmed (retry), reject cancelled, reject not found |\n| `ShipmentRepository.kt` | No | No changes needed; existing save/findById methods are sufficient |\n| `Shipment.kt` | No | No changes needed; enum and data class already include CONFIRMED and CANCELLED statuses |\n| Al